    engine2d_focused_window_corner_aa_device_differs_from_cpu_2026-11-26, 0, "Fresh-device composition of a focused themed WM window (fluid_light, 160x120, window 10,36 120x80) differs from CPU at 20 rounded-corner/edge pixels by one LSB per channel (e.g. (19,36) device 0xFFFCFBFE vs CPU 0xFFFBFAFE) on NVIDIA GB10 and llvmpipe. The unfocused window (opacity 930) matches exactly."

